From: RoboWindows contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Add experimental aggregate worker timing and fallback counters

Pinned DOSBox Pure 7f6e8fb7385fa446d1444d671063268520bf9b54 after 0001-0008.
GPL-2.0-or-later. No guest execution, cycle, cache, linking or pacing changes.
Worker-local counters publish only completed slices; generation resets discard
old work without frontend writes into live worker state. Legacy defaults off.

